<title>USA: AK Steel added to S&amp;P MidCap 400 index.</title>
<headline>AK Steel added to S&amp;P MidCap 400 index.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Standard &amp; Poor's said Friday that it will replace VeriFone Inc in its MidCap 400 Index with AK Steel Holding Corp after the close of trading on June 25.</p>
<p>Verifone is being acquired by Hewlett-Packard Co.</p>
<p>AK Steel is headquartered in Middletown, Ohio. The company produces custom-engineered, flat-rolled steel for the auto, construction and manufacturing markets.</p>
</text>
